==Battleground==
*2 [[Croco]]s spawn after 5.33 seconds<sup>160f</sup>, delay 4~8 seconds<sup>120f~240f</sup>.
*10 [[Croco]]s spawn after 10.67 seconds<sup>320f</sup>, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.
*2 [[Croco]]s spawn after 16 seconds<sup>480f</sup>, delay 6~12 seconds<sup>180f~360f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Jackie Peng]]s spawn after 32 seconds<sup>960f</sup>, delay 33.33~50 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,500f</sup>.
*3 [[Shibalien]]s spawn after 37.33 seconds<sup>1,120f</sup>, delay 26.67~40 seconds<sup>800f~1,200f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 90% HP:
**1 [[Helmut Krabbe]] spawns as the boss.
**1 [[Shibalien]] spawns.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win. Bring any anti-alien units or get the first set of Anti-Unstarred Alien Treasures if you're struggling.

